ira Title

Canada Acquisition – OneStream Integration Enhancement and Timeline Dependencies

Description

Initial research and impact analysis for integrating the new Canada acquisition entity and additional GL accounts into OneStream have been completed.

The team is currently awaiting final requirements and information from the Canada business team before proceeding with the enhancement.

Based on the discussion, the acquisition data is tentatively expected to become available in PeopleSoft around the end of December 2026. As a result, the OneStream enhancement start date will remain on hold until the upstream timeline and required information are confirmed.

Once the Canada team provides the final details and confirms PeopleSoft readiness, the development team will proceed with the necessary OneStream integration and configuration changes.

